    {
      "type": "updated",
      "source": "wgmods",
      "sourceId": "7724",
      "title": "the Dynamic Playlists Mod",
      "previous": {
        "modVersion": "1.4.4.",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.3.0.1",
        "fileName": "the_dynamic_playlist_mod_1.4.4.zip",
        "updatedAt": "2026-07-05T09:49:39.215Z",
        "changeLog": "1.4.4 - Split into four separate .wotmod files (marks, upgrades, weekly,\n        t11grind). Users can now install only the lists they want.\n        Added \"# XP grind for TXI\" list tracking T10 vehicles that still\n        need XP before their T11 successor can be purchased.\n\t- Switched mod_dynpl_t11grind to language-independent internal\n        vehicle name matching - works correctly on all client locales.\n        Fixed T11 predecessor detection for Objekt 430U, Concept No. 5,\n        Leopard 1 and Bat.-Chatillon 25 t."
      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "1.4.3",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.3.0.1",
        "fileName": "mod_dynamic_playlists_v1.4.3.wotmod",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-23T11:33:20.973Z",
        "changeLog": "# Weekly Playlist (new)\n\nA new automatic playlist that displays vehicles matching the current 3-week missions — filtered according to their vehicle restrictions (sub-role, class, nation, level). Sorted by priority within the list: first vehicles with missing Field Mods, then vehicles close to a Gunmark, then the rest. Is automatically rebuilt when you reroll a mission."
      }
    },
